// Stormglass Commons Character Appearance H3J.
//
// This read-only systems-look-development composition replaces the H3I presentation
// wardrobe with native open civic garment geometry, reduces and recesses the ocular
// globes, adds native brows/ears/lips, and clusters the procedural groom. The browser
// witness still uses bounded Three.js material and temporal bridges. This is not a
// production human, biometric likeness, strand groom, native WebGPU TAA, or Quest proof.

composition "Stormglass Character Appearance H3J Civic Landmarks" {
